The forgotten basement part 0 is some text that varies. The forgotten basement part 0 is "You're not going to believe this, but you've just entered a forgotten basement. You begin to take stock of what's in the room.



There is an exit to the south. Don't worry, it is unguarded.".
The description of r_81 is "[forgotten basement part 0]".

The r_9 is mapped south of r_81.
Understand "sleepy bedchamber" as r_96.
The internal name of r_96 is "sleepy bedchamber".
The printed name of r_96 is "-= Sleepy Bedchamber =-".
The sleepy bedchamber part 0 is some text that varies. The sleepy bedchamber part 0 is "Of every bedchamber you could have walked into, you had to saunter into a sleepy one.



There is an unguarded exit to the south.".
The description of r_96 is "[sleepy bedchamber part 0]".

The r_24 is mapped south of r_96.
Understand "misty shower" as r_97.
The internal name of r_97 is "misty shower".
The printed name of r_97 is "-= Misty Shower =-".
The misty shower part 0 is some text that varies. The misty shower part 0 is "You find yourself in a shower. A misty kind of place.



You don't like doors? Why not try going north, that entranceway is unblocked.".
The description of r_97 is "[misty shower part 0]".

The r_25 is mapped north of r_97.
Understand "fun lounge" as r_98.
The internal name of r_98 is "fun lounge".
The printed name of r_98 is "-= Fun Lounge =-".
The fun lounge part 0 is some text that varies. The fun lounge part 0 is "You've just walked into a fun lounge. You decide to start listing off everything you see in the room, as if you were in a text adventure.



There is an unblocked exit to the south.".
The description of r_98 is "[fun lounge part 0]".

The r_26 is mapped south of r_98.
Understand "hot cookery" as r_99.
The internal name of r_99 is "hot cookery".
The printed name of r_99 is "-= Hot Cookery =-".
The hot cookery part 0 is some text that varies. The hot cookery part 0 is "You've entered a hot cookery.



There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unguarded.".
The description of r_99 is "[hot cookery part 0]".

The r_27 is mapped north of r_99.

The o_0 are object-likes.
The o_0 are privately-named.
